<w:p w:rsidR="00A10002"><w:r><w:t xml:space="preserve">The Riverbend Literacy Initiative ran for three years </w:t></w:r><w:r><w:rPr><w:b/></w:rPr><w:t>across four districts</w:t></w:r><w:r><w:t xml:space="preserve"> &amp; reached families that the county&#8217;s earlier &quot;reading hour&quot; scheme never did.</w:t></w:r></w:p>
